{"reviewId": "33137668_85P4Zgc5z", "review": {"abstract": "经济周期理论主体虽然叫经济周期理论，实际上它是一套社会发展理论。经济的运动过程不完全是经济问题，还包括社会制度、政治方面的问题，也包括在座各位在经济周期的运动中如何进行人生规划的问题。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 23, "content": "经济运动影响了个人的行为，还是个人行为影响了经济的运动？我觉得很难说清这个问题，具有反身性。个体觉得经济好，加杠杆猛干，那经济就能繁荣。个体觉得经济在变差，卸掉所有的杠杆，那经济活动就成了一潭死水，就验证了经济差的预期。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "809-901", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "33137668_85P4Zgc5z", "userVid": 33137668, "topics": [], "createTime": 1767230300, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 33137668, "name": "李类", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/hNcMYqibwsnmk1ePpJ74QqnGStycjDCgQBp1WWk2AlRKnyuic45sAnD1wSuN5Ogo1q7wKiclS7cmibqZ20bLau8icNKgpMhCiat5tFGcdrXxlQ8vw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 346925940, "name": "好了不要再说了", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/b5NUSUFLKySPvwoPjVWLJoGntSlegJQsIbjUnh7cDibnR6dQNcAF4sJ3zsoEl1ICwXXQoCcLQaw1dN21ENdGXyA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-50", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title"